{"seq":37,"slug":"dependency-injection-ioc","title":"依赖注入与控制反转","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc","rating":{"composite":4.3,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"依赖注入与控制反转-简介\">依赖注入与控制反转 简介</h1><p>依赖注入（Dependency Injection, DI）与控制反转（Inversion of Control, IoC）是现代软件工程中解耦组件依赖的核心技术。当系统规模增长到数十个服务相互协作时，对象之间的创建与装配关系如果由各个类自行管理，系统将迅速陷入紧耦合泥潭——每次替换一个实现都需要改动散落在多处的 <code>new</code> 调用，单元测试无法隔离外部依赖，生命周期管理靠人工记忆。DI/IoC 正是将&quot;谁创建对象、谁决定依赖关系&quot;这一控制权从业务代码中剥离出来，交给外部容器或调用方管理的系统性解决方案。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦 DI/IoC 这一特定技术的深度实践——从设计原则到容器架构，从注入模式到生命周期管理，从高级模式到工程落地。与同仓库中 backend-architecture-patterns（关注宏观后端架构选型如分层/六边形/微服务）的定位不同，本 hub 不讨论架构范式本身，而是深入&quot;组件之间如何连接&quot;这个微观层面。与 clean-code 和 SOLID 原则 hub 的分工在于：SOLID 提供依赖倒置原则（DIP）的理论基础，本 hub 则将 DIP 落地为可操作的容器配置、注入策略和组织规范。</p>\n<p>第一章&quot;基础原理&quot;建立理论地基。你将理解 DI 的三大核心原则——依赖倒置、关注点分离与好莱坞原则，掌握 IoC 容器的内部架构（注册-解析-释放三阶段），并系统比较构造器注入、属性注入和方法注入三种注入模式的适用场景与权衡。</p>\n<p>第二章&quot;实现机制&quot;进入工程实操。构造器注入为何被 Spring、.NET 官方一致推荐？Singleton/Scoped/Transient 三种生命周期如何正确选择？主流框架（Spring Boot、.NET DI、NestJS、Go Wire）的设计哲学差异如何影响你的代码组织？这些问题将在此章获得具体答案。</p>\n<p>第三章&quot;高级模式&quot;面向中大型系统的架构挑战。Composition Root 模式将所有装配逻辑收敛到应用入口的唯一位置，装饰器与拦截器模式在不修改原有服务的前提下叠加横切关注点，模块边界设计则解决微服务和模块化单体中&quot;容器作用域如何划分&quot;的实际问题。</p>\n<p>第四章&quot;工程实践&quot;将 DI 与日常开发流程衔接。可测试性设计展示如何利用 DI 实现零摩擦的 Mock 替换，反模式清单帮你识别 Service Locator、Captive Dependency 等常见陷阱，迁移策略则为遗留系统提供从手动 new 到容器化的渐进路线图。</p>\n<p>四个章节构成从&quot;为什么&quot;到&quot;怎么做&quot;再到&quot;如何避坑&quot;的完整学习路径。无论你使用 Java、C#、TypeScript 还是 Go，本 hub 的原则和模式都跨语言适用。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础原理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"di-principles","title":"DI 核心原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/foundations/di-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ioc-container-architecture","title":"IoC 容器架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/foundations/ioc-container-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"injection-patterns","title":"注入模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/foundations/injection-patterns"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"implementation","title":"实现机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"constructor-injection","title":"构造器注入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/implementation/constructor-injection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scope-lifecycle","title":"作用域与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/implementation/scope-lifecycle"},{"seq":3,"slug":"framework-comparison","title":"框架对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/implementation/framework-comparison"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"advanced","title":"高级模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/advanced","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"composition-root","title":"Composition Root 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/advanced/composition-root"},{"seq":2,"slug":"decorator-interceptor","title":"装饰器与拦截器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/advanced/decorator-interceptor"},{"seq":3,"slug":"module-boundary","title":"模块边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/advanced/module-boundary"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"testability-mocking","title":"可测试性与 Mock","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/practice/testability-mocking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"anti-patterns","title":"反模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/practice/anti-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"migration-strategy","title":"迁移策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/practice/migration-strategy"}]}]}